1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:08,879
gCaptain reports that three nuclear-powered commercial ship concepts have received early design approvals since June.

2
00:00:08,829 --> 00:00:14,902
The projects include container and car carrier ideas using newer reactor designs.

3
00:00:14,902 --> 00:00:19,564
However, approvals in principle are not construction permits.

4
00:00:19,564 --> 00:00:29,270
Rules, insurance, port access and public acceptance remain major barriers before nuclear merchant ships can trade widely.

